              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 12:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.28.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 28:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.28.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu kumae, Cidhi, man iyer ni dhanu maeni kumae, Wuwinj andha, ento kud wung’ei; wunen andha, ento kud wunen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwok adunde dhanu maeni mio, man dwok ithgi pek, man mi wang’gi; gimaru neno ku wang’gi, man gimaru winjo ku ithgi, man gimaru ng’eyo ku cwinygi, man gimaru lokri kendo, man gimaru cangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alund awacu kumae, Rwoth, rokani? E eloko lembe kumae, Maram adhura bibedo ko ni uvuru ma ng’atu moko mbe i ie, man udi ma dhanu mbe i ie, man maram ng’om bidoko ko ni uvuru ma gwei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man maram Yehova tero ko dhanu bor cen, man ka ma juweko bedo dupa i kind ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man tek fodi apaje ni i ie, en bende jubiwang’e: calu yen ma nok, man calu bongu, ma dunde dong’, kinde ma juredhogi piny; e kumeca kodhi ma leng’ en e dunde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
